                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I met with the outstanding team at @SaolRx, a Georgia-based company that is working tirelessly to bring hope to children and families impacted by Pyruvate Dehydrogenase Complex Deficiency.\n\nSaol\u2019s commitment to advancing a @US_FDA approval for a treatment represents exactly the type of innovation and patient-focused research we should be incentivizing in America.\n\nAs a pharmacist, I\u2019ve seen firsthand how rare disease families often face long, uncertain paths. Saol\u2019s dedication to developing a treatment for a devastating, ultra-rare condition is deeply important work.\n\nI look forward to staying engaged and seeing how this therapy may benefit patients nationwide.",
